    {
      "text": "CEQAnet: project at 1334 and 1348 Miller Avenue (APNs 377-25-053 and 377-25-055) subdivides two lots into eight residential lots and one common access lot; demolishes two single-family homes; builds five single-family homes with attached ADUs, two attached single-family homes and two deed-restricted affordable stacked-flat condominiums.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: maximum height 31 feet; private garages on the first floor of the single-family homes; private open space about 400 to 1,530 sq ft per unit; construction expected to take 11 months.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004183"
      ]
    }
